  "content": "<p><strong>Vertical Hue</strong> is a social housing architectural design by MVN Architecture &amp; Construction Investment JSC, which proudly won 1st Place in the Professional Category at the Genesis Green Living Challenge 2026.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Inspired by Hue&rsquo;s signature garden houses and community-oriented lifestyle, the project translates local cultural values into a modern high-rise living space. Through flexible spatial organization, natural ventilation systems, and a green building framework, Vertical Hue delivers a sustainable living environment tailored to Central Vietnam&rsquo;s climate, elevating the quality of life for social housing residents.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">&nbsp;</h3>"
